## Changes

- Added compact/pretty JSON, instance encode, static encode/toJson nullable adapters, decode/list decode, fromJson and nullable utility adapters to `CheckClientRequestBody`.
- Extended the invoked Java fixture to pin constructors, declared/callable APIs and all nine inherited serialization signatures, with default, explicit-null and populated nested DTO serialization plus null utility cases.
- Added a Rust differential comparing compact/pretty JSON, bytes, static utilities, decode/list decode/fromJson and null list members.
- Updated the Phase 6 API map and Phase 18 release checklist. Plans were not modified.

