## Iteration notes

- The first Rust assertion used source-like Java parameter text; the reflection fixture emits JVM descriptors (`[B` and `[L...;`). The assertion was corrected to the captured signatures and the focused test passed.
- The initial format check identified Rustfmt-only differences in the new test; `cargo fmt --all` corrected them and the final format check passed.

## Status

- This closes the `CheckClientRequestBody` inherited no-feature serialization adapter slice.
- The Java `encode(JSONWriter.Feature...)` overload is reflected and empty features are recorded, but non-empty writer options still need an API/behavior disposition. Other inherited DTO adapters remain under the broad P18-V01 source/API/input/reverse-export audit.
- Full-workspace P18-V02 on the final revision, current-revision Ubuntu/Windows CI evidence, and Phase 19 Docker/Broker automation remain open.
- No Docker/Broker, push, tag, publication or release action was performed.
